 CTRL SHIFT  -- Redraw


     To cancel an operation, hold CTRL and SHIFT while releasing or clicking
   the mouse button.

     A question mark cursor is a request for confirmation.  Click the mouse
   button to confirm, hold CTRL and SHIFT and click the mouse button to cancel.
